menu "Penalty development tests"
    config PENALTY_DEV_BLE_FAULTS
        bool "Enable controlled BLE disconnect tests (development only)"
        default n
        help
            Adds a DOWN-long test panel during an active multiplayer round.
            Disconnects a real GAP link and suppresses rediscovery for 10 or
            35 seconds without clearing match state. Never enable for release.
endmenu
